#: .\core\setup.py:154
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Your household ({household_id}) has a leak-monitoring board waiting to be set up.\n\nSetup code: {code}\nExpires: {expires}\n\n1. Plug in the board and wait about a minute.\n2. On your phone, join the WiFi network '{board_setup_ssid}' (password: {board_setup_password}).\n3. A setup page opens by itself. If it does not, open http://192.168.4.1/ in your browser.\n4. Choose your home WiFi, type its password, and enter the setup code above. Leave the server address as it is.\n5. Press Save. The board restarts and joins your WiFi; the setup network disappears.\n\nSign in at {site}, open Settings > My device, and watch it change to Connected. The code works once. If it expires or something goes wrong, you can get a new one there."
msgstr "May leak-monitoring board ang sambahayan mo ({household_id}) na naghihintay na i-setup.\n\nSetup code: {code}\nMag-e-expire: {expires}\n\n1. Isaksak ang board at maghintay ng mga isang minuto.\n2. Sa phone mo, kumonekta sa WiFi network na '{board_setup_ssid}' (password: {board_setup_password}).\n3. Kusang bubukas ang setup page. Kung hindi, buksan ang http://192.168.4.1/ sa browser mo.\n4. Piliin ang WiFi ng bahay mo, i-type ang password nito, at ilagay ang setup code sa itaas. Hayaan na lang ang server address.\n5. Pindutin ang Save. Mag-re-restart ang board at kokonekta sa WiFi mo; mawawala ang setup network.\n\nMag-sign in sa {site}, buksan ang Settings > My device, at hintaying maging Nakakonekta ito. Isang beses lang gumagana ang code. Kung mag-expire ito o may mali, pwede kang kumuha ng bago doon."

