msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Alisin"

#: .\templates\facilitator\segments.html:303
msgid "No boards registered."
msgstr "Wala pang naka-register na board."

#: .\templates\facilitator\segments.html:304
msgid "A board is normally registered while adding the household that owns it. Use &ldquo;Register a board&rdquo; above for a spare."
msgstr "Karaniwang nire-register ang board habang idinadagdag ang sambahayang may-ari nito. Gamitin ang &ldquo;Mag-register ng board&rdquo; sa itaas para sa spare."

#: .\templates\facilitator\segments.html:314
msgid "To set up a board: join its <span class=\"mono\">LeakDetect-Setup</span> hotspot, enter the WiFi and the <strong>claim code</strong>. The board fetches its own ID and key from the server - you never type the key, and nothing needs re-flashing."
msgstr "Para i-set up ang board: kumonekta sa <span class=\"mono\">LeakDetect-Setup</span> hotspot nito, ilagay ang WiFi at ang <strong>claim code</strong>. Kukunin ng board ang sarili nitong ID at key mula sa server - hindi mo kailangang i-type ang key, at wala nang kailangang i-flash ulit."

#: .\templates\facilitator\segments.html:335
msgid "One hose per household, created with the household."
msgstr "Isang linya kada sambahayan, ginagawa kasabay ng sambahayan."

#: .\templates\facilitator\segments.html:357
#: .\templates\facilitator\segments.html:409
msgid "Map colour"
msgstr "Kulay sa mapa"

#: .\templates\facilitator\segments.html:367
