#: .\templates\owner\pressure.html:70
msgid "How hard the water is pushing. Higher means a stronger flow at your tap. It falls when the source is low, and when there is a leak between the source and your house."
msgstr "Kung gaano kalakas ang tulak ng tubig. Mas mataas, mas malakas ang daloy sa gripo mo. Bumababa ito kapag mababa ang source, at kapag may tagas sa pagitan ng source at ng bahay mo."

#: .\templates\owner\pressure.html:78
msgid "How much water is moving through your line right now. It should be zero when nobody at home is using any &mdash; water moving when every tap is closed is what the system watches for."
msgstr "Kung gaano karaming tubig ang dumadaloy sa linya mo ngayon. Dapat zero ito kapag walang gumagamit sa bahay &mdash; ang tubig na umaagos kahit sarado ang lahat ng gripo ang binabantayan ng system."

#: .\templates\owner\pressure.html:88
msgid "Your household has no hose line set up yet, so there are no readings to show. Ask the water system facilitator to add one."
msgstr "Wala pang naka-set up na linya ang sambahayan mo, kaya wala pang reading na maipapakita. Hilingin sa facilitator ng water system na magdagdag ng isa."

