#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:140
#, python-format
msgid "Open <strong>http://192.168.4.1/</strong> in your browser and type: your home WiFi name and password, the setup code <strong data-device=\"code2\">%(code)s</strong>, and the server <strong data-setup-server-text>%(server)s</strong>."
msgstr "Buksan ang <strong>http://192.168.4.1/</strong> sa browser mo at i-type: ang pangalan at password ng WiFi sa bahay mo, ang setup code na <strong data-device=\"code2\">%(code)s</strong>, at ang server na <strong data-setup-server-text>%(server)s</strong>."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:147
msgid "Is the board plugged in and its light on? After a power cut it reconnects by itself within a minute."
msgstr "Nakasaksak ba ang board at nakabukas ang ilaw nito? Pagkatapos ng brownout, kusang kokonekta ulit ito sa loob ng isang minuto."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:148
msgid "Is your home WiFi working, with internet? Try opening any website on your phone."
msgstr "Gumagana ba ang WiFi ng bahay mo, may internet? Subukang buksan ang kahit anong website sa phone mo."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:149
#, python-format
msgid "Did the WiFi name or password change? The board needs to be told: unplug it, wait two minutes, plug it in - the <strong>%(setup_ssid)s</strong> network reappears and you can enter the new WiFi, without a code."
msgstr "Nagbago ba ang pangalan o password ng WiFi? Kailangang sabihin ito sa board: tanggalin sa saksakan, maghintay ng dalawang minuto, isaksak ulit - lalabas ulit ang <strong>%(setup_ssid)s</strong> network at mailalagay mo ang bagong WiFi, nang walang code."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:150
msgid "Still nothing after that? Contact the water system facilitator."
msgstr "Wala pa ring nangyari pagkatapos niyan? Kontakin ang facilitator ng water system."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:159
msgid "Send the code to me again"
msgstr "Ipadala ulit sa akin ang code"

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:163
msgid "Get a new setup code"
msgstr "Kumuha ng bagong setup code"

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:184
msgid "Install the app"
msgstr "I-install ang app"

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:186
msgid "Put this portal on your home screen. It opens full screen like a normal app, works when the signal is weak, and can alert you about your water. Nothing is downloaded from Play Store or App Store."
msgstr "Ilagay ang portal na ito sa home screen mo. Bubukas ito nang full screen tulad ng normal na app, gumagana kahit mahina ang signal, at puwedeng mag-alerto sa iyo tungkol sa tubig mo. Walang ida-download mula sa Play Store o App Store."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:195
msgid "This page is open on an address that phones will not install from. Installing needs an <strong>https://</strong> address. Ask the water system facilitator for the right link."
msgstr "Nakabukas ang page na ito sa address na hindi mai-install ng mga phone. Kailangan ng <strong>https://</strong> address para mai-install. Hingin sa facilitator ng water system ang tamang link."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:203
msgid "This portal is already installed on this phone. You are using it now."
msgstr "Naka-install na ang portal na ito sa phone na ito. Ginagamit mo na ito ngayon."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:207
msgid "Install on this phone"
msgstr "I-install sa phone na ito"

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:211
msgid "How to install on an iPhone or iPad"
msgstr "Paano i-install sa iPhone o iPad"

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:213
msgid "Open this page in <strong>Safari</strong>. Chrome on an iPhone cannot install it."
msgstr "Buksan ang page na ito sa <strong>Safari</strong>. Hindi ito mai-install ng Chrome sa iPhone."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:214
msgid "Tap the <strong>Share</strong> button at the bottom of the screen &mdash; the square with an arrow pointing up."
msgstr "I-tap ang <strong>Share</strong> button sa ibaba ng screen &mdash; ang parisukat na may arrow paitaas."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:215
msgid "Scroll down the list and tap <strong>Add to Home Screen</strong>."
msgstr "Mag-scroll pababa sa listahan at i-tap ang <strong>Add to Home Screen</strong>."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:216
msgid "Tap <strong>Add</strong> at the top right."
msgstr "I-tap ang <strong>Add</strong> sa kanang itaas."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:218
msgid "The icon appears on your home screen with your other apps."
msgstr "Lalabas ang icon sa home screen mo kasama ng iba mong app."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:222
msgid "How to install on an Android phone"
msgstr "Paano i-install sa Android phone"

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:225
msgid "Tap the <strong>three dots</strong> at the top right."
msgstr "I-tap ang <strong>tatlong tuldok</strong> sa kanang itaas."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:226
msgid "Tap <strong>Install app</strong>, or <strong>Add to Home screen</strong>."
msgstr "I-tap ang <strong>Install app</strong>, o <strong>Add to Home screen</strong>."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:227
msgid "Tap <strong>Install</strong>."
msgstr "I-tap ang <strong>Install</strong>."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:243
msgid "Alerts on this phone"
msgstr "Mga alerto sa phone na ito"

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:245
msgid "Get a notification the moment something is wrong with your water, even when the app is closed. You will still get a text message either way."
msgstr "Makatanggap ng notification sa sandaling may problema sa tubig mo, kahit nakasara ang app. Makakatanggap ka pa rin ng text message kahit ano ang mangyari."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:253
msgid "Notifications are not set up on the system yet, so this cannot be switched on. Nothing is wrong with your phone."
msgstr "Hindi pa naka-set up ang mga notification sa system, kaya hindi pa ito mabubuksan. Walang problema sa phone mo."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:258
msgid "For the facilitator:"
msgstr "Para sa facilitator:"

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:261
msgid "This phone&rsquo;s browser cannot show notifications. On an iPhone, install the app to your home screen first, then come back here."
msgstr "Hindi makapagpakita ng notification ang browser ng phone na ito. Sa iPhone, i-install muna ang app sa home screen mo, saka bumalik dito."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:268
msgid "Notifications are blocked for this site in your phone&rsquo;s settings. You will need to allow them there before this can be switched on."
msgstr "Naka-block ang mga notification para sa site na ito sa settings ng phone mo. Kailangan mo itong payagan doon bago mabuksan ito."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:275
msgid "Turn on alerts"
msgstr "I-on ang mga alerto"

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:279
msgid "Alerts are on for this phone."
msgstr "Naka-on ang mga alerto sa phone na ito."

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:281
msgid "Send a test"
msgstr "Magpadala ng test"

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:282
msgid "Turn off"
msgstr "I-off"

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:301
msgid "Phones getting alerts"
msgstr "Mga phone na tumatanggap ng alerto"

#: .\templates\owner\settings.html:303
#, python-format
msgid "%(count)s phones in your household are set up for alerts. Turning them off above only affects the phone you are using."
msgstr "%(count)s phone sa sambahayan mo ang naka-set up para sa mga alerto. Ang pag-off sa itaas ay para lang sa phone na ginagamit mo."

#: .\templates\registration\login_code.html:3
#: .\templates\registration\login_code.html:20
msgid "Enter your code"
msgstr "Ilagay ang iyong code"

#: .\templates\registration\login_code.html:24
#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_done.html:15
#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_form.html:17
msgid "Back to sign in"
msgstr "Bumalik sa sign in"

#: .\templates\registration\login_code.html:33
#, python-format
msgid "A 6-digit code was sent by text to <strong>%(dest)s</strong>. It expires %(minutes)s minutes after it was sent."
msgstr "Isang 6-digit na code ang ipinadala sa text sa <strong>%(dest)s</strong>. Mag-e-expire ito %(minutes)s minuto matapos ipadala."

#: .\templates\registration\login_code.html:35
#, python-format
msgid "A 6-digit code was sent by email to <strong>%(dest)s</strong>. It expires %(minutes)s minutes after it was sent."
msgstr "Isang 6-digit na code ang ipinadala sa email sa <strong>%(dest)s</strong>. Mag-e-expire ito %(minutes)s minuto matapos ipadala."

#: .\templates\registration\login_code.html:38
msgid "No code is waiting. Request one below."
msgstr "Walang naghihintay na code. Humiling ng isa sa ibaba."

#: .\templates\registration\login_code.html:49
msgid "Code"
msgstr "Code"

#: .\templates\registration\login_code.html:71
msgid "Did not get it?"
msgstr "Hindi natanggap?"

#: .\templates\registration\login_code.html:72
msgid "text"
msgstr "text"

#: .\templates\registration\login_code.html:74
msgid "Wait a minute before asking again"
msgstr "Maghintay ng isang minuto bago muling humiling"

#: .\templates\registration\login_code.html:74
msgid "Send a new code"
msgstr "Magpadala ng bagong code"

#: .\templates\registration\password_change.html:7
msgid "Change your password"
msgstr "Palitan ang password mo"

#: .\templates\registration\password_change.html:8
msgid "Choose something only you know, then keep using the same username."
msgstr "Pumili ng ikaw lang ang nakakaalam, tapos gamitin pa rin ang parehong username."

#: .\templates\registration\password_change.html:12
#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_confirm.html:13
msgid "Save new password"
msgstr "I-save ang bagong password"

#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_complete.html:3
#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_complete.html:7
msgid "Password changed"
msgstr "Napalitan ang password"

#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_complete.html:8
msgid "Your new password is ready. Sign in with it now."
msgstr "Handa na ang iyong bagong password. Mag-sign in gamit ito ngayon."

#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_complete.html:10
msgid "Go to sign in"
msgstr "Pumunta sa sign in"

#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_confirm.html:3
#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_confirm.html:8
msgid "Choose a new password"
msgstr "Pumili ng bagong password"

#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_confirm.html:9
msgid "Pick something only you know. You'll sign in with it next time."
msgstr "Pumili ng alam mo lang. Gagamitin mo ito sa susunod na pag-sign in."

#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_confirm.html:16
msgid "This link has expired"
msgstr "Nag-expire na ang link na ito"

#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_confirm.html:18
msgid "A reset link works once and only for a short time. Request a fresh one and use the newest email."
msgstr "Isang beses lang gumagana ang reset link at sa maikling panahon lang. Humiling ng bago at gamitin ang pinakabagong email."

#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_confirm.html:21
msgid "Request a new link"
msgstr "Humiling ng bagong link"

#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_done.html:3
#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_done.html:7
msgid "Check your email"
msgstr "Tingnan ang iyong email"

#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_done.html:9
msgid "If an account matches that address, a reset link is on its way. Open it and choose a new password. It can take a minute to arrive; check spam if you don't see it."
msgstr "Kung may account na tumutugma sa address na iyon, parating na ang reset link. Buksan ito at pumili ng bagong password. Maaaring tumagal ng isang minuto bago dumating; tingnan ang spam kung hindi mo ito makita."

#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_done.html:12
msgid "No email on your account? Ask your facilitator to set a new password for you."
msgstr "Walang email sa iyong account? Hilingin sa iyong facilitator na magtakda ng bagong password para sa iyo."

#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_email.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid "Hello %(name)s,"
msgstr "Kumusta %(name)s,"

#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_email.txt:1
msgid "Hello,"
msgstr "Kumusta,"

#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_email.txt:3
#, python-format
msgid "Someone asked to reset the password for your Smart Hose Leak Detection System account (%(username)s). If that was you, choose a new password here:"
msgstr "May humiling na i-reset ang password ng Smart Hose Leak Detection System account mo (%(username)s). Kung ikaw iyon, pumili ng bagong password dito:"

#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_email.txt:10
msgid "The link works once and expires soon. If you did not ask for this, you can ignore this email - your password stays the same."
msgstr "Isang beses lang gagana ang link at malapit na itong mag-expire. Kung hindi ikaw ang humiling nito, puwede mong balewalain ang email na ito - mananatili ang password mo."

#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_form.html:3
#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_form.html:7
msgid "Reset your password"
msgstr "I-reset ang iyong password"

#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_form.html:9
msgid "Enter the email on your account. If we have it on file, we'll send a link to choose a new password. The link works for a short time and once only."
msgstr "Ilagay ang email na nakatala sa iyong account. Kung mayroon kami nito, magpapadala kami ng link para pumili ng bagong password. Gumagana ang link sa maikling panahon at isang beses lang."

#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_form.html:14
msgid "Email me a reset link"
msgstr "Padalhan ako ng reset link"

#: .\templates\registration\password_reset_subject.txt:1
msgid "Reset your Smart Hose Leak password"
msgstr "I-reset ang Smart Hose Leak password mo"
